        "text": "§\n\nAdverse Effects (4) : Inhaled anesthetics",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (4) : Inhaled anesthetics\n\n(1) Cardiac depression\n(2) Malignant hyperthermia\n\n(3) Respiratory depression\n\n(4) ↓ Cerebral vascular resistant ⇒ Edema\n\n(Note: N2O is an exception, it does NOT cause respiratory depression or malignant hyperthermia)\n\n[Image: da79c02a6c1f28c9a097a1ca9f970eaea4ad02dc1b31cd8d82b1910149581954]\n\n[Image: cd8d09690d2a6539eafdaab815d6ca99fd9248a430d99b7f79a983bb98b73dbe]\n\n[Image: 424f17da3f440dddc8b1470bd300fff3415ec3ac23701c4393a2ab90e2319c3c]\n\n[Image: de0bc7c387c3b6838a6646b7886b13956e7025114226f3959cad2b62120e4f0f]\n\n2.2 - Inhaled anesthetics, dantrolene\n[Image: 841351d541bd1828e52d927251f5aacc57e51e7a1e46005a8cd8b78e8d28e735]\n\n[Image: 9778704df2765446c1484487e7b9c9e6997c463d608a23a3626bab8278b1d02d]\n\n[Image: e01e35cdcba99d0842810e410179d824206ac2f5bf7e2cc6e28ecee89d3026d8]\n\n[Image: 8406284991efa74ea239e04834e15735af6121805ec033faa0fa97cbadf4c981]\n\n[Image: befecdd7943656d961805680c16c53d71f31eb2074b6f57ac0a52a6d08aec2b1]",
